# Current Model

## Current Dataset
Pima Indians Diabetes Dataset

## Current Features
- Pregnancies
- Glucose
- Blood Pressure
- Skin Thickness
- Insulin
- BMI
- Diabetes Pedigree Function
- Age

## Current Algorithm
XGBoost Classifier

## Current Accuracy
69.5%

## Current Limitations
- Uses only the Pima dataset.
- No external validation.
- Limited patient features.
- Educational use only.

## Future Improvements
- Compare multiple machine learning models.
- Add larger and more diverse datasets.
- Improve explainability for both doctors and patients.
- Enhance the user interface.
- Add PDF report generation.





